msgid "Exporting for visionOS"
msgstr "為 visionOS 匯出"

msgid ""
"This page describes how to export a Godot project to visionOS. If you're "
"looking to compile export template binaries from source instead, "
"see :ref:`doc_compiling_for_visionos`."
msgstr ""
"本頁說明如何將 Godot 專案匯出到 visionOS。若你要從原始碼編譯匯出範本二進位"
"檔，請參考 :ref:`doc_compiling_for_visionos`。"

msgid ""
"Exporting instructions for visionOS are very similar "
"to :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios`. You can refer to it for more details about "
"the Xcode workflow."
msgstr ""
"visionOS 的匯出步驟與 :ref:`doc_exporting_for_ios` 非常相似。有關 Xcode 工作"
"流程的詳細資訊，請參閱該文件。"

msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "系統需求"

msgid ""
"`Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`_ (from the macOS App Store)."
msgstr ""
"`Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`_（可從 macOS App Store 取得）。"

msgid ""
"An Apple account, for code-signing (`free for on-device testing <https://"
"developer.apple.com/support/compare-memberships/>`_)."
msgstr ""
"用於程式碼簽署的 Apple 帳號（`在實體裝置上測試可免費使用 <https://"
"developer.apple.com/support/compare-memberships/>`_）。"

msgid ""
"Projects written in C# are currently not supported on visionOS, as "
"the :ref:`.NET runtime <doc_c_sharp_platforms>` does not support visionOS."
msgstr ""
"目前 visionOS 尚不支援使用 C# 撰寫的專案，因為 :ref:`.NET 執行階段 "
"<doc_c_sharp_platforms>` 不支援 visionOS。"

msgid "App Role"
msgstr "App 角色"

msgid ""
"The **Window** mode (default) presents your game in a flat window, similar "
"to an iOS app."
msgstr "**Window** 模式（預設）會以平面視窗呈現遊戲，類似 iOS App。"

msgid "The **Immersive** mode presents your game as an XR app."
msgstr "**Immersive** 模式會以 XR App 的形式呈現遊戲。"

msgid ""
"For more information about the immersive mode, see :ref:`doc_visionos_intro`."
msgstr "如需進一步瞭解沉浸模式，請參閱 :ref:`doc_visionos_intro`。"

msgid "Immersion Mode"
msgstr "沉浸模式"

msgid ""
"The **Mixed** immersion style displays your Godot game on top of the "
"passthrough environment. The **Full** and **Progressive** immersion styles "
"display your game on top of an opaque background and defines a 1.5-meter "
"boundary around the player."
msgstr ""
"**Mixed** 沉浸樣式會將 Godot 遊戲顯示在透視的周遭環境上。**Full** 和 "
"**Progressive** 沉浸樣式則會在不透明背景上顯示遊戲，並在玩家周圍設定 1.5 公尺"
"的邊界。"

msgid ""
"See Apple's `Human Interface Guidelines <https://developer.apple.com/design/"
"human-interface-guidelines/immersive-experiences#Immersion-styles>`_ for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"詳情請參閱 Apple 的 `人機介面指南 <https://developer.apple.com/design/human-"
"interface-guidelines/immersive-experiences#Immersion-styles>`_。"
